      "text": "Segment forwards events\nto 140+ analytics tools\n(GA, Mixpanel, etc).\n\nEach destination gets\nits own service + queue.\nOne stalls — only that\nqueue backs up.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Segment forwards events\nto 140+ analytics tools\n(GA, Mixpanel, etc).\n\nEach destination gets\nits own service + queue.\nOne stalls — only that\nqueue backs up.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
