      "text": "Traffic Recorder records\neach destination's real\nHTTP response once, then\nreplays it on every test.\n\nFull 140+ destination\nsuite: milliseconds.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Traffic Recorder records\neach destination's real\nHTTP response once, then\nreplays it on every test.\n\nFull 140+ destination\nsuite: milliseconds.",
